<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Labský důl–Pančavský vodopád–Pramen Labe circuit — Labský důl–Pramen Labe–Pančavský vodopád full circuit [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>From the P3 foot entrance, follow the blue marked route through Labský důl to Labská bouda, visit Pramen Labe, then follow the upper marked paths past Pančavský vodopád and Vrbatova bouda and return through Horní Mísečky and Vodovodní cesta. Allow about seven hours; the retained approximately 786 m ascent/descent figures are inherited planning estimates, not a new elevation survey.

